# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `coverage/` matches a directory
# of that name at ANY depth — and it did: src/core/coverage/ was silently
# untracked for the whole life of the branch, so every local build passed
# against a file the repository did not contain. `out/` and `build/` are
# anchored for the same reason.
